Protocol reference: ITU-R M.493-16, Annex 1 (2023).
SDRangel's GPL-3.0-or-later DSC code was consulted to cross-check character
coding, phasing, time diversity and message interpretation. This repository
is a new Python implementation, not a verbatim translation of that code.
